{"id":"761122a1ac76e177","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-constructible-transitivity.md","title":"构造层级的传递性与递增性","display":"thm-constructible-transitivity — 构造层级的传递性与递增性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-constructible-transitivity","aliases":["72-thm-constructible-transitivity"],"display":"thm-constructible-transitivity — 构造层级的传递性与递增性","depends_on":["[[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV Definition1.2.1, print215/PDF227; local transfinite induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-constructible-transitivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-constructible-transitivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-constructible-transitivity — 构造层级的传递性与递增性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a817d4e9e855b803\" href=\"?note=a817d4e9e855b803\" title=\"72-df-constructible-hierarchy\">72-df-constructible-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV Definition1.2.1, print215/PDF227; local transfinite induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a817d4e9e855b803\" href=\"?note=a817d4e9e855b803\" title=\"72-df-constructible-hierarchy\">72-df-constructible-hierarchy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> 遍历实际序数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ \\forall a\\in L_\\alpha\\ (a\\subseteq L_\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ \\forall a\\in L_\\alpha\\ (a\\subseteq L_\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (\\alpha\\le\\beta\\Rightarrow L_\\alpha\\subseteq L_\\beta),\\qquad\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (L_\\alpha\\subseteq\\operatorname{Def}_s(L_\\alpha)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (\\alpha\\le\\beta\\Rightarrow L_\\alpha\\subseteq L_\\beta),\\qquad\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (L_\\alpha\\subseteq\\operatorname{Def}_s(L_\\alpha)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同时作超限归纳。在传递 M 中，每个 a∈M 等于由参数 a 在 M 内定义的集合 {x∈M:x∈a}，故 M⊆Def(M)；M=∅ 时包含平凡。每个 Def(M) 元素是 M 的子集，再由 M⊆Def(M) 得 Def(M) 传递。极限的递增并保持传递与包含。任意 α≤β 的包含再由递增阶段归纳得到。此处只使用 Def 的明确构造，无需假设 Lα 已满足 KP。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-constructible-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"a817d4e9e855b803","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-constructible-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"a817d4e9e855b803","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_\\alpha$ 使用 [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]]；$\\alpha,\\beta$ 遍历实际序数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ \\forall a\\in L_\\alpha\\ (a\\subseteq L_\\alpha).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (\\alpha\\le\\beta\\Rightarrow L_\\alpha\\subseteq L_\\beta),\\qquad\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (L_\\alpha\\subseteq\\operatorname{Def}_s(L_\\alpha)).","display":true}],"bytes":1640,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-512","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["a817d4e9e855b803"]}